@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff

title LiveKit 集群：Redis 是消息总线不是媒体面

package "节点 A" {
  [RTC Service] as RA
  [Room 2222] as R1
  [Room 3333] as R2
}
package "节点 B" {
  [RTC Service] as RB
  [Room 2222 只在节点A] as R3
}
database "Redis" {
  [Pub/Sub 主题] as PUBSUB
  [节点心跳 集合] as HEARTBEAT
  [房间路由 room-nodeId] as ROUTE
}

RA --> ROUTE : 注册房间归属
RB --> ROUTE : 查询房间所在节点
RA --> PUBSUB : 跨节点信令转发
RB --> PUBSUB : 订阅节点消息
RA --> HEARTBEAT : 周期心跳
note right of PUBSUB
  ingress 配置必须填 redis.address：
  ingress 收到的 RTMP 流经 Redis
  路由到房间所在节点的 SFU 推流
end note
note bottom
  媒体 RTP 永远走 UDP 直连节点
  Redis 只承载控制面
end note
@enduml
